<h1 data-copy-en="Sabbath" data-copy-zh="Sabbath">Sabbath</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Hut access, spell lessons, crafting, personal H2Hs and Grimoire level 9." data-copy-zh="小屋入口、法术课程、制作、个人谈心与魔导书 9 级。">Hut access, spell lessons, crafting, personal H2Hs and Grimoire level 9.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mystic_Seduction_and_Extras"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ninth_Hex:_Grimoire_Level_9"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafting:_The_Second_Pulse"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafting:_Void-Kissed_Charm"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gandon_Errands_and_Black_Panties"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Witch-Marked"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Black_Cabinet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_Encounter"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Scenes_and_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Suggested_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Find_the_Hidden_Hut"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Sabbath — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sabbath.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Sabbath — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sabbath.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Sabbath — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Sabbath offers Alchemy, Ritual Mastery, Infinity Dungeon crafting and the Grimoire’s level-9 upgrade. Her personal cabinet/H2H chain is separate from Gandon’s errands.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>From the Whispering Woods, entering the Witches’ Hut requires effective Mystic 45 and Perception 45. Her ordinary portrait appears on odd-numbered days, 18:00–24:00. The daytime shared events below use their own locations and windows.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Witch's Hut</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">18:00–24:00 odd days</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Personal_Plot_Choices"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>The Black Cabinet opens at Known (25). Cabinet Lesson follows it at Acquaintance (50); Price of Pretty Things is a separate Friend (100) step. Finish both the lesson and that event for Witch-Marked at Close Friend (200), then Closer at Crush (400). The Bazaar date is an independent one-time Friend activity.</p><p>Gandon’s tasks require accepting the current quest from him before visiting Sabbath. Seduce Sabbath requires 500 ordinary affection and supplies its required Black Panties key item on entry; do not search for a shop purchase. See the Wizard guide for the full errand order.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Wrong Kind of Healing</th><td data-label="Requirements">Village Healer's Hut; 08:00–19:00; Amelia Acknowledged (10); Sabbath Friend (100); The Healer's Hut; Sabbath not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Sabbath +4; Amelia +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Caterpillar Brew</th><td data-label="Requirements">Whispering Woods; 08:00–19:00; Sabbath Close Friend (200); Sabbath not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Sabbath +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Discipline Under Siege</th><td data-label="Requirements">Monk's Temple Training Hall; 14:00–18:00; Sabbath Close Friend (200); Sabbath not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Sabbath +6; Monk +2</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Gift_Scene"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Sabbath</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Alchemy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; $250; −50 Energy; −50 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+50 base affection; Alchemy; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ritual Mastery</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Friend (100); Mystic 22</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">240 min; $500; −60 Energy; −60 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+15 base affection; Ritual Mastery; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Lingerie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; 1 Lingerie</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+15 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Epic Ingredient</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min; 1 epic ingredients</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft Void-Kissed Charm</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min; 3 Void-Touched Fang; 5 Abyssal Eye; 2 Soul Thread</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Void-Kissed Charm ×1; repeatable while materials last</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft The Second Pulse</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; 3 Mutagenic Ichor; 4 Soul Thread; 1 Gilded Heart; 2 Shimmering Heartscale</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">The Second Pulse; max Health +10%; fully restores Health; once; +25 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ninth Hex</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; In Love (3000); Grimoire exactly level 8; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; −110 Energy; −80 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Grimoire 8 → 9; once; +10 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Use Mystic Seduction</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Stranger (0); Mystic 70; Mystic Seduction; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+40 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Black Cabinet</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +12 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cabinet Lesson</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Acquaintance (50); The Black Cabinet</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Price of Pretty Things</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +14 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonlit Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Friend (100); 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $75; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +5 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Witch-Marked</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Close Friend (200); The Black Cabinet; The Price of Pretty Things</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Crush (400); Witch-Marked</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −20 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seduce Sabbath</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; 500 affection; 500 affection; the key item has not already been obtained</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Black Panties; dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Forbidden Knowledge</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Witch's Hut; Known (25); Communication 60</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 direct affection; Mystic +1; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Alchemy and Ritual Mastery are real one-time paid lessons. Give Epic Ingredient consumes the Epic ingredient tier; Common and Rare do not substitute. The two craft recipes use the listed Infinity Dungeon drops, not ordinary crafting materials.</p><p>The Second Pulse increases maximum Health by 10% and fills Health on completion. Ninth Hex needs In Love (3000) and a Grimoire at exactly level 8; it upgrades 8 → 9. Use Mystic Seduction needs the learned skill and Mystic 70, gives 40 base affection and marks one randomly selected Extras scene; repeated selections are possible.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: Christmas gift</summary><p>Give Christmas Gift needs Close Friend (200), an unused Christmas gift token and no previous gift to this character. Use her ordinary portrait at the hut on odd days 18:00–24:00. It spends one token and 30 minutes, giving 100 direct affection once. There is no calendar-date requirement or extra ingredient purchase.</p></details><p>On restored saves, the Grimoire upgrade can be offered without its initial full-version access restriction. Its affection, exact equipment level and one-time completion requirements still apply.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Mystic 55; Perception 55; attractiveness 40</p><p>Favorite skill: Deception</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>A high relationship does not remove the hut entrance stats or odd-day portrait schedule. Carry the exact recipe quantities. For Ninth Hex, a level-7 or already-level-9 Grimoire does not qualify. For the personal H2Hs, complete both the prior H2H and its named event where listed.</p></section>
